---
description: Fetch Jira and Figma via cloud MCP using workshop-config before planning or implementing
globs: ["app/**/*.tsx", "components/**/*.tsx", "docs/**/*.md"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read @docs/workshop-config.json for the instructor-provided jiraIssueKey and figmaDesignUrl (participants do not create new Jira/Figma assets).
- For requirements, use Atlassian MCP to retrieve that Jira issue before planning or implementing.
- For design, use Figma MCP (e.g. get_design_context) for figmaDesignUrl before UI implementation or visual validation.
- Do not use local markdown files as the source of truth for story or design; Jira and Figma MCP are required.
- Report in docs/REPORT-4521.md which MCP tools were used and the config keys referenced.